## 4. Feature Specifications by Portal

### 4.1 Customer Portal (Responsive Web)
* **Authentication:** Mobile Number + Firebase OTP Verification.
* **Service Catalog:** Dynamic grid by category (Electrical, Plumbing, Carpentry, Cleaning, Appliance Repair, Tutoring).
* **Location Intelligence:** Auto-detect location via Google Maps Geolocation API + manual PIN/address selector.
* **Worker Recommendation Engine:** Displays top recommended verified workers based on Trust Score, Distance, and Pricing.
* **Voice-Based Booking:** Web Speech API integration allowing users to speak service requests in local languages (Hindi/English).
* **Payment Integration:** Razorpay Test Mode supporting UPI, Cards, and Net Banking.
* **Live Job Tracking:** Status progression timeline (Requested ➔ Accepted ➔ In Transit ➔ In Progress ➔ Completed).
* **Rating & Sentiment Feedback:** Star rating (1–5) + text review triggering auto-sentiment classification.

### 4.2 Worker Portal (High-Accessibility PWA)
* **OTP Login & Language Toggle:** Simple single-tap login with Hindi/English language switcher.
* **Availability Toggle:** Clear visual switch (ONLINE / OFFLINE) with location polling.
* **Job Request Notification Card:** Large visual banner showing Service Type, Customer Distance, Estimated Payout (85%), and Accept/Decline countdown.
* **Active Job Dashboard:** One-touch navigation launch (Google Maps route), OTP job start validation, job completion workflow.
* **Earnings Ledger:** Daily/Weekly breakdown showing gross total, 85% net earnings, coop share, and direct bank payout status.
* **Welfare & Social Security Hub:** Single-view access to active insurance coverage (PMSBY/PMJJBY), cooperative micro-loan eligibility, and skill training modules.
* **Offline Request Sync:** Queue accepted actions in IndexedDB when network disconnects, auto-syncing upon reconnection.

### 4.3 Admin Dashboard (Cooperative Operations)
* **Real-time Map Heatmap:** Visual layer powered by Google Maps JS API displaying live worker pins, active bookings, and high-demand zones.
* **Worker Verification Queue:** Document viewer (Aadhaar, Skill Certificate, Cooperative Member ID) with one-click Approve/Reject buttons.
* **Inter-Cooperative Pooling Monitor:** Live feed showing pooled bookings shared between cooperatives and referral fee accounting.
* **Demand Forecasting Panel:** Visual charts predicting upcoming 7-day demand spikes per category using synthetic historical data.
* **Complaint & Sentiment Dashboard:** Review stream flagged by automated sentiment analysis (Negative reviews flagged for immediate admin callback).

